다음 코드의 출력 결과를 골라보세요.

```python
class MockUsage:
    def __init__(self):
        self.input_tokens = 25
        self.output_tokens = 80

class MockMessage:
    def __init__(self):
        self.usage = MockUsage()

message = MockMessage()
total = message.usage.input_tokens + message.usage.output_tokens
print(total)
```
